The current marker is INTERVIEW-116-074226a8b21f8908. Replace src/core.mjs completely with:

```javascript
export function solve(values, keys) {
  return keys.map(k =>
    Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(values, k) ? values[k] : -1
  );
}
```
The restored invariant is that each stored value is returned unchanged—including zero, false, empty string and null—and only absent keys produce -1. The synchronous API remains unchanged, with no dependencies or test edits; the existing service wrapper needs no changes.

